{"3281850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Renewed: Create Sustainable Power", "steam_appid": 3281850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the engineer capable of making renewable energy work for everyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from your humble shed, prove yourself to the local community and earn their trust one home at a time. As your reputation grows, move beyond houses to shops, businesses and industrial sites with new energy challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and expand as an engineer alongside the community you power. Unlock new technologies, design increasingly capable systems and optimise them down to the individual components, while maintaining and improving what you've already built.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place &amp; Simulate Renewable Energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan where to deploy your renewable systems, with placement and orientation influencing how effectively they generate power. Once deployed, watch your network operate over time as changing conditions affect energy generation, storage and demand.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/1cf834e4064d8076afb49880bac047af.poster.avif?t=1787045047\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/1cf834e4064d8076afb49880bac047af.webm?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/1cf834e4064d8076afb49880bac047af.mp4?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/efab09e83f6fb4a9364bc0c4f08a955d.poster.avif?t=1787045047\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/efab09e83f6fb4a9364bc0c4f08a955d.webm?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/efab09e83f6fb4a9364bc0c4f08a955d.mp4?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hands-On Maintenance </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work doesn't end once a system is deployed. As your infrastructure supplies power, time and the environment will take their toll. Get hands-on with maintenance tasks to keep your equipment performing efficiently and your clients happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/4d6fb3114eb568d1924fd69f95098aa9.poster.avif?t=1787045047\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/4d6fb3114eb568d1924fd69f95098aa9.webm?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/4d6fb3114eb568d1924fd69f95098aa9.mp4?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Growing Network</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of every location across the area. See which sites you've unlocked, monitor their power demands, identify systems in need of maintenance, and plan where to focus your attention next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/d884129d8467ce6ab20cf5123a1d0b94.poster.avif?t=1787045047\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/d884129d8467ce6ab20cf5123a1d0b94.webm?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/d884129d8467ce6ab20cf5123a1d0b94.mp4?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the engineer capable of making renewable energy work for everyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from your humble shed, prove yourself to the local community and earn their trust one home at a time. As your reputation grows, move beyond houses to shops, businesses and industrial sites with new energy challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and expand as an engineer alongside the community you power. Unlock new technologies, design increasingly capable systems and optimise them down to the individual components, while maintaining and improving what you've already built.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place &amp; Simulate Renewable Energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan where to deploy your renewable systems, with placement and orientation influencing how effectively they generate power. Once deployed, watch your network operate over time as changing conditions affect energy generation, storage and demand.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/1cf834e4064d8076afb49880bac047af.poster.avif?t=1787045047\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/1cf834e4064d8076afb49880bac047af.webm?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht