er demands, identify systems in need of maintenance, and plan where to focus your attention next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/d884129d8467ce6ab20cf5123a1d0b94.poster.avif?t=1787045047\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/d884129d8467ce6ab20cf5123a1d0b94.webm?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/extras/d884129d8467ce6ab20cf5123a1d0b94.mp4?t=1787045047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Design, build and optimize your renewable power systems! Choose the right components, meet growing energy demands and unlock new technology on your journey to become the best engineer and create sustainable power.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/f2119f5ad1e5a7d2a64107f23b3f24844651d844/header.jpg?t=1787045047", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/23933cdf54051e39e014bbd8acf8f3cd62ac90bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787045047", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281850/23933cdf54051e39e014bbd8acf8f3cd62ac90bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787045047", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-6400, AMD Ryzen 5 1400, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050Ti, AMD Radeon RX 470 graphic